  <data name="About_LtscBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This is the Lite edition of ICC-CE (InkCanvasForClass Community Edition), aimed at day-to-day classroom use.

How it differs from upstream: stability comes first, changes are verified on real hardware before release; wording is rewritten for how teachers actually use it; no chasing of new features.

When reporting a problem, include the version shown at the top of this page so we can tell whether it is an upstream issue or one introduced here.</value>
